<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title><%= siteName %> - Terms and Services</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/authentication/terms.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
</head>

<body>
  <canvas id="backgroundCanvas"></canvas>

  <main class="terms-page">
    <header class="terms-hero">
      <a href="/" class="logo-section" aria-label="Go to ARNI home">
        <img src="/images/common/logo.png" alt="<%= siteName %> Logo" />
      </a>

      <p class="eyebrow">Legal Information</p>
      <h1><%= siteName %> Terms and Services</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Please read these terms carefully before using our website or shopping with us.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="terms-content">
      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-file-signature"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and using <%= siteName %>, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Services.
            If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access our website or use our services.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-shirt"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>2. Products and Services</h2>
          <p>
            Our website offers clothing and fashion accessories for sale. All products are subject to availability.
            We reserve the right to discontinue any product at any time.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>All product descriptions are accurate to the best of our knowledge.</li>
            <li>Colors may vary slightly from what appears on your screen.</li>
            <li>Sizing information is provided in product descriptions.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-credit-card"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>3. Pricing and Payment</h2>
          <p>
            All prices are listed in <%= currency %> and are subject to change without notice.
            Payment must be made through our approved payment methods. We use secure payment
            processing systems to protect your information.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-truck-fast"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>4. Shipping and Delivery</h2>
          <p>
            We ship to the locations listed in our shipping policy. Delivery times may vary depending
            on your location. Shipping costs will be calculated at checkout.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-rotate-left"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>5. Returns and Refunds</h2>
          <p>
            Our return policy allows returns within <%= returnPeriod %> days of purchase.
            Items must be unused and in original packaging. Please see our Returns Policy for complete details.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>6. Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>
            Your privacy is important to us. Please review our Privacy Policy to understand how we collect,
            use, and protect your personal information.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-copyright"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            All content on this website, including images, text, and logos, is the property of
            <%= siteName %> and is protected by copyright laws.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <section class="contact-info">
        <p class="contact-title">Have questions about these Terms and Services?</p>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <p>
            <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
            <span>Email:</span>
            <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a>
          </p>

          <p>
            <i class="fas fa-phone"></i>
            <span>Phone:</span>
            <a href="tel:<%= contactPhone %>"><%= contactPhone %></a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: <%= lastUpdated %></p>

      <div class="page-actions">
        <a href="/auth/signin" class="btn-secondary">
          <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i>
          Back to Sign Up
        </a>

        <a href="/" class="btn-primary">
          <i class="fas fa-house"></i>
          Go Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/javascripts/authentication/terms.js"></script>
</body>
</html>